<title>USA: Johnson Controls special factors to boost Q2.</title>
<headline>Johnson Controls special factors to boost Q2.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Controls Inc said on Wednesday that special factors will result in a net gain of $0.28 per fully diluted share to earnings for the second quarter ending March 31.</p>
<p>The factors include a $0.76 gain from the sale of its plastic container division, a $0.44 a share loss for a restructuring charge and a $0.04 a share loss related to strikes at two of its seating plants and a strike at a General Motors Corp assembly plant.</p>
</text>
